OL,3,GNEWSACity road closed after
OL,4,Asingle-vehicle crash
OL,5,
OL,6,FA busy road in Derby has closed
OL,7,Ffollowing a serious crash involving a
OL,8,Fsingle car.
OL,10,FOfficers closed Warwick Avenue between
OL,11,FBurton Road and Carlton Road, heading
OL,12,Fnorthbound towards Royal Derby
OL,13,FHospital, on Wednesday afternoon.
OL,15,FThe road will likely remain closed for
OL,16,F"some time", Derbyshire Police said.
OL,18,FDrivers are being advised to avoid the
OL,19,Farea.
